    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Stone speaks to you, warning of impending danger.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Stone Sense<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your tremorsense increases to a range of 20 feet, At mythic tier 5 it increases to 25 feet, and at mythic tier 10 it increases to 30 feet.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc89\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
